      "typical_award_size": "HACM administers 2,705 Housing Choice Vouchers and owns 421 public housing units countywide; project-based vouchers are attached to private developments including Midway (Dos Palos), El Mirador (Los Banos), Gateway Terrace, The Retreat and Grove (Merced), with site-based waiting lists mostly closed; RAD conversions are under way (Phase 1 Gateway Homes, Phase 2 scattered sites); HACM also operates the USDA-funded Felix Torres Farmworker Housing Center in Planada (60 year-round units) and four seasonal migrant centers (Atwater, Merced and others). No current PBV request for proposals was posted.",
